OL,3,GNEWSAFunding boost for historic Wigan
OL,4,Atheatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to bring an historic theatre back
OL,7,Finto use have taken a major step
OL,8,Fforward after new investment was
OL,9,Fapproved.
OL,11,FWigan's Royal Court Theatre on King
OL,12,FStreet will receive part of the #3.7m
OL,13,Ffunding Wigan Council is set to receive
OL,14,Ffrom the Greater Manchester Combined
OL,15,FAuthority, to  support the borough's
OL,16,Feconomy and community developments.
OL,18,FThe Grade II listed theatre, which
OL,19,Fclosed in 1974 and was used as a bingo
OL,20,Fhall, nightclub and bar, has already
OL,21,Freceived #1.1m in funding for building
OL,22,Fworks.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
