OL,3,GNEWSAFunding boost for historic Wigan
OL,4,Atheatre
OL,5,
OL,6,FCllr Dane Anderton said the latest
OL,7,Ffunding will help bring the theatre a
OL,8,Fstep closer to becoming "a vibrant
OL,9,Fdestination for residents and
OL,10,Fvisitors".
